Z||000000||Cheever2||01-18-2001||11:12 PM||||Skitime posted something that inspired me to ponder what it would be like if we had our own TV network, i.e. The Total Fiero Network (TTFN).  All Fieros, all the time.  Brought to you by Pennock Productions.<P>Gotta have a soap: <B>Guiding Headlight</B> - On today's show, FieroLisa accuses SlammedFiero of spending more money on his car than on her.  But she doesn't know it's not the <I>car</I> diverting his cash! <P>And don't miss: <B>Cooking With RiceCooker</B> - Mmmm, nothing so nice as steamed rice! Watch the fun as RC puts Teflon-coated non-stick woks under the tires of an ultra-modded Civic, then challenges them to a race.<P>Prime time: <B>Archie's Place</B> - Our reluctant hero has to pull another Zumwalt Special, and runs for cover when parts start falling out all over the place.  (Parents' warning: this show contains graphic language)<P>Fiero tech tips: <B>Cat's In the Cradle</B> - TheOgre masterfully shows how to pass an emissions inspection.  Every street racer needs to see this. <P>C'mon, everybody, what's your idea for...<BR>-Game show<BR>-Nature show<BR>-Survivor spinoff<BR>-Sports<BR>-???<BR> <P>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 01-18-2001).]||||reg||6
