Z||000003||DJRice||01-19-2001||12:01 AM||||-Survivor Spinoff:<P>Temptation Island - Put one PFF member on an Island with a 4 cylinder Fiero in decent condition.  The only other things on the island are a fully equipped machine shop and a junkyard containing a wrecked 2000 V6 Firebird, 2000 Grand Prix GT (with 3.8L), Boneville SSEI (3.8L supercharged), and any late modeld caddilac powered by a Northstar V8.  <P>The winner gets 1 million dollars if he/she can last 2 months on the island without swapping the engine, stereo, seats, shifters, etc. out of any one of the junked cars.  <P>Tempt this person daily by forcing them to read the forum topics on the advantages/disadvantages of each type of engine swap and kill stories from those who have done these swaps and schooled numerous hondas on the road.  <P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>"You mean like the back seat of a Volkswagen?"<p>[This message has been edited by DJRice (edited 01-19-2001).]||||reg||1
