Z||000009||Cheever2||01-19-2001||02:15 AM||||On Saturdays, there's more on our network that the whole family will love: <P><B>Tigger's Wild Kingdom</B> introduces us to amazing creatures like MonkeyMan and BatBoy.  On this week's special live show, we have in the studio Fiero5, Pontiaddict and Seanh with all their Ferrets!  Those little buggers sure enjoy riding in Fieros (and so do the ferrets).<P><B>Race-a-me Street</B> is always a gas with Count_iblis doing what he does best: "That's 21,436 '88 Fieros for the database guy, ah-ah!  Oh! There's 21,437 '88 Fieros for the database guy, ah-ah!"<P>*** *** *** This is Fiera Fiero with some BREAKING NEWS... in a junkyard near Denver, there's a "mrfiero" who is attempting to dismantle and remove, piece by peice, a complete Fiero, and leave nothing behind.  He's currently BREAKING off the locking lugnuts.  We'll BREAK in with any new developments of this BREAKING story.*** ***<P>Commercial:  "Howdy, folks, this is yer ol' buddy FieroDave here with lots more specials every day to meet all yor Fiero needs.  We got red Fieros, we got white Fieros, we got black Fieros, blue Fieros, green Fieros, yellow Fieros.  Why, I'll even send my partner, AL, all the way out to Californ-I-A if that's what it takes to git you the best deal on a sorta-new Fiero.  And as you know, NOBODY kin find a better deal than AL!"<P>*** *** *** This is Fiera Fiero in the newsroom again... let's go to my7fieros in Memphis with another breaking story.  "That's right, Fiera, I'm here with Songman, who says he saw Elvis pumping gas into an Indy Fiero Pace Car.  Is that your claim, Songman?"  "Yeah, I DID!  I wuz over here waitin' for the red light, and there he wuz, wearin' nuthin' but them blue suede shoes.  I said DON'T LOOK, ETHEL!  But it wuz too late, she done seen the Pelvis!"*** *** ***<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 03-29-2001).]||||reg||6
