Z||000019||Cheever2||01-19-2001||12:14 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by hugh:<BR><B>How about MR. PENNOCK'S NEIGHBORHOOD?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Today, boys n girls, we're going to visit our new neighbor MR2.  That name sort of reminds you of MR T, doesn't it?  Let's hope MR2 is in a better mood than MR T.  Oh, there he is now.  Looks like he's repairing something.  We better not get too close when things are broken, we may hear something we shouldn't.  Besides, MR2 guys always get tense when Fiero people are around.  That car is a Toyota, can you say Toyota?  Nice try!  Do you know what Toyota means?  It's Japanese for Toy Auto, that's right.  MR2's look like little toy autos, don't they?  Sure.  And I'll let you in on a little secret: they RUN like toys, too!  Okay, we'll just leave MR2 alone in his own little Magic Kingdom...<BR>   <BR>||||reg||6
