Z||000040||DaRkLoRD||01-20-2001||04:15 PM||||There's always other talk-show topics..<P>"I have too many Fieros"<BR>"I'm addicted to Fieros and I can't stop buying them!"<P>and possibly a Fiero makeover show? (new wheels, new paint, leather seat covers, etc)<BR>"Oh wow!! I hardly recognize it!!"<P>or the game show.. "Who Wants to be a Fiero Owner".. contestants answer questions relating to the Fiero and hope to win the elusive prize.. a mint 1988 yellow 5spd, t-top, Fiero GT..<P>For the scifi/drama lovers, there's The R-Files.. a pair of agents go around investigating mysterious cases, such as the infamous "ricer", who isn't what he appears to be..<BR>Scully: "Mulder, are you trying to suggest that this Civic actually ISN'T a VTEC??"<BR>Mulder: "Yes Scully.. think about it, there were numerous reports of UFO activity in this area right before this car was spotted."<BR>Scully: "Mulder, I'm sure there's a logical scientific explanation for this.."<BR>Mulder: "..and also, you can see where the DX badge was pried off.."<BR>Scully: "I'd better get this VTEC badge back to the lab for analysis.. what the, it's just stuck on with double sided tape!"<BR>TO BE CONTINUED.......<P>The truth is out there..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||10
