Z||000066||Cheever3000||08-18-2001||08:13 PM||||Would you say this is now a re-run, in syndication?<P>While I'm reminiscing, here's one I did, from the Dennis Miller thread last fall...<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>"Well, okay, here you are. It's 4th down and you've got inches to go. Why not take a time out and just think about this? You could go for it, but if you miss they've got great field position which puts them in striking distance of the end zone. But remember, you still have your lifelines: you can punt, you can try a field goal which from here looks like a 50/50 chance, or you can call your agent. Feel pretty confident, do you? I see your Mom behind you looking very nervous..."<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>||||reg||1
